  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\n**Logic : 2(1st number × 2nd number) = 3rd number**\n\nGiven :\n\n \n• (3, 4, 24)\n\n​2(3 × 4) = 24\n\n2 × 12 = 24\n\n24 = 24 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n \n• (4, 5, 40)\n\n​2(4 × 5) = 40\n\n2 × 20 = 40\n\n40 = 40 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (4, 6, 36)\n\n​2(4 × 6) = 36\n\n2 × 24 = 36\n\n**48 ≠ 36 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (5, 7, 42)\n\n​2(5 × 7) = 42\n\n2 × 35 = 42\n\n**70 ≠ 42 (LHS ≠ RHS) **\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (3, 7, 21)\n\n​2(3 × 7) = 21\n\n2 × 21 = 21\n\n**42 ≠ 21 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (2, 7, 28)\n\n2(2 × 7) = 28\n\n2 × 14 = 28\n\n**28 = 28 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, **\"Option - (4)\"** is the correct answer.\n\n43:T1288",
